flowchart TD
    U[User clicks Save tab<br/>web or extension] --> FE[Frontend]
    FE --> API[POST /items endpoint]
    API --> RLS{RLS check<br/>role allowed?}
    RLS -->|no| ERR[4xx UPPER_SNAKE_CASE<br/>see 18-error-codes.md]
    RLS -->|yes| DB[(Insert into items)]
    DB --> LOG[(Append history_events)]
    LOG --> RES[201 + item payload]
    RES --> TOAST["Toast: Saved → item appears"]
    ERR --> ETOAST[Error toast with code]
